    note: tried 2026-11-26 with a local server (no TLS): 100 SSE chunks of 2 KB at 100 ms, the client blocking its loop 400 ms per chunk (59 s) and a plain 250-chunk 25 s stream; neither dropped, so a blocked loop alone does not explain it, a cut by the server, the TLS path or a proxy is more likely

